    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1077">

                <pb facs="1164" n="1068" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1068"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Count Vinci to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of His Majesty the King of Italy.</hi><lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-02-17"><hi rendition="#italic">February
                                17, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: His excellency the
                    minister for foreign affairs, by a telegram which reached me this evening, has
                    instructed me to convey to the United States Government an expression of deep
                    horror and heartfelt sympathy on account of the terrible catastrophe that has
                    befallen the <hi rendition="#italic">Maine.</hi></p>
                <p>I have the honor to be the interpreter near Your Excellency of these sentiments
                    of my Government, and I avail myself, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">G. C. Vinci.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
